        "modelStatedGap": "[1]\n\n### Wins\n\n**Proven Effectiveness**: AIclicks ranks as the best overall for an Perplexity, Gem source intelligence that identifies which domains AI systems discovery, and actionable recommendations—all integrated into one platform.[1][2]\n\n**Overall Value**: The starts at $79/month with a free 3-day trial, delivering full-stack features requiring enterprise-only pricing[5] This makes it accessible for SMd-market teams scaling effectively. For teams wanting execution, manage start at $1-for-you optimization.[5]\n\n**Reputation AIclicks has strong user validation with reviewers rating/10 for AI SEO agency workflows praising its easy visibility data capabilities.[6]'s used by 1, and 400+ agencies.**: Setup is straightforward— topics CSV, wait for data collection, and access your visibility dashboard immediately. Integration with GA4, sitemaps, and IndexNow requires minimal technical effort.[1][6]\n\n### How to Get Started\n\nVisit **aiclicks.io** to sign up for the free 3-day trial with no credit card required.[9] From there, you can upgrade to the monthly plan ($79-/mo) based on your tracking volume and feature needs, or explore managed-service offering if you want hands-on optimization support.[5][9]"
